# Marked Localization Update
# Locale: de (German)
# Feature: Missing/untranslated UI strings + folder navigation / Finder replace review
# Generated: 2026-11-26
#
# HOW TO TRANSLATE
# ----------------
# Fill in or edit the German translation on each "key" = "..."; line.
# Keep keys and format specifiers (%lu, %@) unchanged. Do not translate
# product names (Marked, MarsEdit, Finder, Dock, Markdown, CSS) unless
# German already localizes them.
#
# The last four Settings.strings entries and the MainMenu*.strings entries
# are machine-translated drafts already in Marked/de.lproj/ for review.
#
# Return this file with translations filled in (same filename).
# Merge with: python3 scripts/merge_localization_updates.py <this-file>

